   "sourceHash": "2d4492e43e75722884a072472f3cb0326f92e728a32c94810c4e6aa1c5df03be",
   "text": "静静欣赏 Healing Village 的绿意与自然环境。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
